    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u4e1c\u65b9\u7eee\u6a31\u7ed8\u00a0\uff5e\u00a0Categorical\u00a0Imperative\u00a0Valid?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a program that lets you enter the <i>Touhou Project</i>\u2019s Gensokyo, allowing you to have ultra-fair danmaku battles against the girls there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551130/extras/96dabcbd24b7adcf31ea7588015d6088.avif?t=1754142976\" width=200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Write your own story. </strong>We will collect data about your soul and appearance. You\u2019ll be able to wear your favorite clothes and move freely throughout Gensokyo. Try forging your own adventure story in Gensokyo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551130/extras/7199de624b187c860262c56a7f4e8629.poster.avif?t=1754142976\" width=638 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551130/extras/7199de624b187c860262c56a7f4e8629.webm?t=1754142976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551130/extras/7199de624b187c860262c56a7f4e8629.mp4?t=1754142976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551130/extras/89e32b2402a7793190c338407c0a57e7.poster.avif?t=1754142976\" width=312 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551130/extras/89e32b2402a7793190c338407c0a57e7.webm?t=1754142976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551130/extras/89e32b2402a7793190c338407c0a57e7.mp4?t=1754142976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. A System for Fair Danmaku Battles. </strong>The bullets of enemies in this game will damage not only you, but other enemies as well. Therefore, you\u2019ll need to learn how to \u201ccooperate\u201d with enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551130/extras/c7a279d080fd13c7e4a65210f61ca6d7.poster.avif?t=1754142976\" width=396 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551130/extras/c7a279d080fd13c7e4a65210f61ca6d7.webm?t=1754142976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551130/extras/c7a279d080fd13c7e4a65210f61ca6d7.mp4?t=1754142976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Merit and Scoring Systems. </strong>You\u2019ll be judged by the Yama for hurting living beings, while saving a single life is more deserving of Merit than constructing a seven-storied stupa. Try to accrue Merit and obtain the associated rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551130/extras/de3d3fa4ce7543bc01f534450a18b5e4.poster.avif?t=1754142976\" width=396 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551130/extras/de3d3fa4ce7543bc01f534450a18b5e4.webm?t=1754142976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551130/extras/de3d3fa4ce7543bc01f534450a18b5e4.mp4?t=1754142976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4. Money System. </strong>The funds acquired in game will persist, and can be used at Kourindou to obtain more powerful weapons, spell cards, and items. Work hard to earn more funds and strengthen yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551130/extras/d7ed4c029cecc7cb76551dc8101039c0.poster.avif?t=1754142976\" width=314 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551130/extras/d7ed4c029cecc7cb76551dc8101039c0.webm?t=1754142976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551130/extras/d7ed4c029cecc7cb76551dc8101039c0.mp4?t=1754142976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551130/extras/16317cc9436ce800ddb486e4bbfae58b.poster.avif?t=1754142976\" width=314 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551130/extras/16317cc9436ce800ddb486e4bbfae58b.webm?t=1754142976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551130/extras/16317cc9436ce800ddb486e4bbfae58b.mp4?t=1754142976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5. Your choices will lead Gensokyo to multiple possible futures. Listen to the Touhou-styled yet also rebelliously rock-styled music, and begin your adventure now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551130/extras/c0c768c745fde7632408bb8a14df7ff1.poster.avif?t=1754142976\" width=398 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551130/extras/c0c768c745fde7632408bb8a14df7ff1.webm?t=1754142976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551130/extras/c0c768c745fde7632408bb8a14df7ff1.mp4?t=1754142976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551130/extras/a014b1074379357d37a8258332cde282.avif?t=1754142976\" width=200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometime after the Flower Incident, in Autumn of one year, purple cherry blossoms appeared again in Gensokyo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These purple cherry blossoms were made to bloom by the spirits of <strong>sinners </strong>possessing the flowers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why had the spirits of sinners appeared in Gensokyo? Set out on an adventure and reveal the truth!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Notice of Originality</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hereby declare that <i>Categorical Imperative Valid?</i> was independently developed by Team Categorical Imperative Valid?. No Artificial Intelligence tools were used in the course of development, and other than those already noted, this program does not contain any publicly released work of any other person or organization. Persons or organizations who have made important contributions have been credited prominently in game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Asset Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Categorical\u00a0Imperative\u00a0Valid?</i> is an openly-available project based on LuaSTG ex+. Any user who purchases <i>Categorical\u00a0Imperative\u00a0Valid?</i> is allowed to use and modify the work\u2019s music, visual assets, and code in any manner; giving credit is not required. However, the development team takes no responsibility for the consequences of improper use of the assets.</p>",
